    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d6-a9">

                <pb facs="0056" n="50" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg50"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Honolulu, Oahu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1843-02-18"><hi rendition="#italic">February 18,
                        1843</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Salutations to Lord George Paulet, captain of Her Britannic Majesty’s ship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Carysfort.</hi></p>
                <p>I have received your communication and make known to you that I will receive
                    yourself and Her Britannic Majesty’s representative on Monday, the 20th of
                    February, at 11 o’clock a.m.</p>
                <p>Yours respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kamehameha III</hi>.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>I hereby certify the above to be a faithful translation.</p>
                    <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. P. Judd</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Translator for the
                        Government.</hi></signed></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
